{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hi, mera bill bahut zyada aaya hai, please check karo! 😡",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Hello! Welcome to Nimbus Telecom. I am Daniel. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Yaar, my bill is 5000 rupees, it should be 1500. Yeh kya ho raha hai? I am so frustrated!",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I am sorry to hear that you are feeling frustrated, Aisha Johnson. I can definitely look into this for you.",
    "tags": ["empathy"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Haan, please check. My number is 97817 86860 and I live at 138 Brigade Road.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you. I see a double charge for the international roaming pack. It looks like a mistake on our end.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Exactly! Maine toh sirf ek pack buy kiya tha. Please fix it fast.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I will raise a refund request for the wrong charge right now.",
    "tags": ["action:refund_request"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Okay, kab tak aayega refund?",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Please note that the refund is subject to approval and usually takes 7-10 business days to reflect in your account.",
    "tags": ["disclosure"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Theek hai, that is fine. Thank you for the quick help, Daniel!",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "You are very welcome! Is there anything else I can assist you with today? I have raised the request, and you will get an email confirmation. Goodbye!",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  }
]}
